      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Once a rough area, Intendente is now celebrated for its vibrant street art, multicultural food stalls, and craft beer bars.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.washingtonpost.com/travel/portugal/intendente-neighborhood-lisbon/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Casa Independente, a cultural hub in Intendente, hosts emerging artists and offers a garden lounge that feels like a backyard tool shed with hipster light bulbs.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
        24,
        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.washingtonpost.com/travel/portugal/intendente-neighborhood-lisbon/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A library housed in a former tile factory warehouse showcases books on Portuguese photography and the city’s history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
